\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_LOW_CazadorsPalace_Crypt_ScrollOfNames</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_CazadorsPalace_Crypt_ScrollOfNames\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_CazadorsPalace_Crypt_ScrollOfNames\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">da5e9241-31d7-4b93-a65b-a521f3c1385d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:da5e9241-31d7-4b93-a65b-a521f3c1385d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:da5e9241-31d7-4b93-a65b-a521f3c1385d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador%27s_Palace\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cazador's Palace\">Cazador's Palace</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1986&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;854</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Names. Thousands of them. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Many of the surnames would be familiar to a <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldurian</a>, though some of those near the beginning of the list are of families now long disappeared. This is a list of names of people dating back centuries, but continuing right up to the present day.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202301\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1408/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23654/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5442/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936097/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.697      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.697      1 -total\n 49.46%   20.623      6 Template:Icon_text\n 42.53%   17.733     15 Template:Trim\n 22.28%    9.291      2 Template:Uid\n 15.59%    6.501      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.38%    5.578      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.39%    5.165      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.22%    5.097      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.10%    4.212      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12676-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202301 and revision id 394530. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}